    "body": "Nah, I was the reviewer there, the onus is on me. (Also, I'm a maintainer, making that doubly true).\r\n\r\nSo I don't know if this is still true, but back when I was first learning command line shenanigans a decade ago, I found that adding a `-` to tar options made them more order-sensitive, sometimes in ways that didn't agree with each other on different platforms.\r\n\r\nDo we know that this problem no longer exists? Or perhaps it's an issue that I entirely imagined?",
