    "body": "Yes, I'm just not sure how that works on other platforms.\r\n\r\nI guess another way to think of the question is this: can we think of a value of VERBOSE that will break the dashless form in a bad way (e.g. extracting the wrong file, passing inadvertent flags to `tar`) but won't break the dash form?",
